window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I’m a broken Omega.<br> <br> A hybrid wolf shifter</p> <p>An abomination to dragonkind.<br> <br> If these Alpha dragons find out, they’re going to send me back to the nomad lands… <i>to die</i>.<br> <br> They already suspect that I’m something “other.”<br> <br> Hence the evaluations and trials laid out before me.<br> <br> So when my Alpha guard offers me a set of magical gold coins, I try to use them to buy favor with the Royal Court.<br> <br> Except they want <i>more</i>.<br> <br> To survive, I strike a deal with my handsome guard—I’ll give him whatever he wants in exchange for more of his golden enchantments.<br> <br> There’s just one problem.<br> <br> I underestimated the cost of this agreement.<br> <br> Because it turns out there’s only one thing my Alpha guard wants.<br> <br> And it’s the one thing I can’t give…<br> <i>An heir</i>.</p> <p><b>Author’s Note:</b> <i>Gold Sector</i> is a “Rumpelstiltskin” retelling that features a fast-paced, fast-burn plot and a happily-ever-after ending.</p>"; 
